      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had the error when investigating another Jython issue.  I have encountered the \u0027future feature print_function is not defined\u0027 while using Jython 2.5.3: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/gerrit/issues/detail?id\u003d16068#c1\n\nI guess I can repurpose this change to document the inspector requires Jython 2.7+ ?",
      "parentUuid": "794d0957_8d479783",
      "revId": "a793805549415dbbdaf125296a8e4b884cb2def2",
